o me!","start":153.828,"end":155.0,"words":[[1,71],[71,93],[93,111],[111,151]]},{"sec":"V4","n":15,"text":"Ten days after \"pace\" \u2014 surprise!","start":155.028,"end":156.64,"words":[[31,53],[53,81],[81,111],[111,129],[129,129],[129,199]]},{"sec":"V4","n":16,"text":"Opus 5.5: \"Hi, guys!\"","start":156.628,"end":158.58,"words":[[39,71],[71,157],[157,193],[193,251]]},{"sec":"C4","n":1,"text":"We didn't start the scaling","start":158.628,"end":160.7,"words":[[51,73],[73,107],[107,133],[133,145],[145,313]]},{"sec":"C4","n":2,"text":"It was always training, and the curves kept gaining,","start":162.027,"end":167.2,"words":[[47,77],[77,107],[107,135],[135,341],[341,355],[355,371],[371,415],[415,453],[453,677]]},{"sec":"C4","n":3,"text":"We didn't start the scaling","start":168.427,"end":170.0,"words":[[37,59],[59,93],[93,117],[117,129],[129,177]]},{"sec":"C4","n":4,"text":"Now we swear we'll try to pace it \u2014 but we'd rather race it!","start":170.026,"end":173.38,"words":[[17,37],[37,53],[53,79],[79,97],[97,113],[113,135],[135,167],[167,179],[179,179],[179,199],[199,219],[219,281],[281,315],[315,521]]},{"sec":"C4","n":5,"text":"We didn't start the scaling","start":173.826,"end":176.96,"words":[[141,159],[159,195],[195,221],[221,233],[233,497]]},{"sec":"C4","n":6,"text":"But when we log off... will it still train on?","start":178.426,"end":193.98,"words":[[37,57],[57,81],[81,99],[99,215],[215,359],[359,385],[385,393],[393,419],[419,681],[681,999]]},{"sec":"outro","n":1,"text":"(And on, and on, and on\u2026)","start":194.624,"end":198.56,"words":[[58,122],[122,208],[208,348],[348,374],[374,396],[396,438]]}]}